# Per-clade pipeline outputs — large derived data, regenerable via
# scripts/per_clade_alignment_pipeline.py + scripts/run_all_clade_pipelines.sh
# (commands recorded in per-clade commands.log and manifest.json).
# Patterns use **/ so they match two-level output paths like 0/0_0000/sequences.fa.
full_prophages.idx.json
**/sequences.fa
**/sequences.fa.fai
**/allwave.paf
**/allwave.paf.impg
**/allwave.segmented.paf
**/allwave.segmented.paf.impg
**/partitions.bed
**/partitions/
**/pipeline_run.log
pipeline_driver.log
pipeline_results.json
**/distances.npz
rerun.log
**/*.fa.fai
